sequenceDiagram
    participant MD as marketdata
    participant BUS as BUS
    participant MOD as model
    participant BK as book
    participant S as strategy
    participant R as recorder

    MD->>BUS: market.depth / market.candle (TTL: drop)
    BUS->>MOD: latest state
    MOD->>MOD: compute number
    MOD->>BUS: model.decision (epoch ts, TTL 5m)
    BUS->>BK: decision
    BK->>BK: record in intel window
    BK->>BK: pattern? >= N agreeing
    BK->>S: tier signal
    S->>BK: open / close
    BK->>BUS: model.fill / model.pnl
    BUS->>R: record envelope
    R->>R: write lake once
